": "38347751224815589", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620965_38347751238148921_5057248519300288108_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zg-sMqEM8WAQ7kNvwHCIJ-O&_nc_oc=AdoUyK0QmvYhBJrfkB0DlHc1u-MSr9AFx5FNUnt7kiwotIGexr5zk9vg3OJj66Sp93o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI7g1vDnWxUHtBJi5apgO86pGPRl4s-QNuHYznMoNrn3w&oe=6A9D7C97"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot2-lane_1.png", "id": "1344809297858874", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604282317_1344809301192207_4447666598631232526_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eUYjjLq8KyMQ7kNvwGhVW8L&_nc_oc=AdqYo-orIyT_sPqMdC-5PNXDUG3ZEyEbw0wADkkHeRtbBwYYi1YIEQdFBoQZPr41ks4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ5LlvGMzkQhSIwa04eJ27UjIB2sBDS2IEQZ0uPadnGzw&oe=6A9D868B"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot3-depth-alt_1.png", "id": "1040915801870464", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623400_1040915808537130_4781429846582066514_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X5YzaW7Y484Q7kNvwH1PwYa&_nc_oc=AdqZIg-B7c6OqFQykHZhKRlLPQ7E2LpMGDtinMd76YIN4nsqZfFmUfsdYaqgyDhPjiw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLbWHfVVqpy5frUnkXLdf50_qcjBy81VzBAG8V2s9b-5Q&oe=6A9D878E"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot4-score_1.png", "id": "27554383440855653", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624983_27554383447522319_1875656870862086556_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0WdqFg-w5r8Q7kNvwFmyrJt&_nc_oc=Adq9E7UYnlnRConR-urQIhGuKMCC4PR2_vdEd_b9SvQKtJlUcRWEvYRgjbqhoav8nGQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI97XVB-C7QgZE5NLoMn5W-Hp45qMZ00vKAUwyHiw01pw&oe=6A9D70B6"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot5-rest_1.png", "id": "1706333930584924", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622211_1706333933918257_8714833817623575886_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H19FwexpWxIQ7kNvwEaXv4U&_nc_oc=AdptCFQFqmvw_3st-YkAVtgF8OxqJnlhQvrCLAk19FNlajOI4Mq69u_kwcgxEnFY1a0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKU-2AT9aEYyIG_J69iLf1VfjNwquksYv5BayFkPSl4Bw&oe=6A9D7C94"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "AxeArcade_trailer_cover.png", "id": "1061070172992027", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604282317_1061070176325360_7984314788343204879_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OFI2vdMOXSAQ7kNvwGUfl2h&_nc_oc=AdoGBg5CaCDg1sSgTteDY28w_9hsicWHbSm_Ij9WFfb4jGvi8mMH0GkmI_xjpCmu-eo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI6oDQN6iUYLwTEgafYaQyKKpHEx5EebhYEB-0OqQUt8A&oe=6A9D5993"}, "display_name": "Axe Arcade", "keywords": ["axe", "throwing", "arcade", "bullseye", "casual"], "long_description": "**How good is your throw?**\n\nPick up an axe with a natural grip, feel its weight as you wind up, and send it spinning end-over-end into the board. Every throw is pure physics and timing \u2014 nail the bullseye for the big score and chase a higher total round after round.\n\n## What you do\n- Grab the axe anywhere on the handle \u2014 grip button, either hand.\n- Wind up and release with a real throwing motion; the axe flies the way you throw it.\n- Hit the target board \u2014 the closer to the bullseye, the bigger the score.\n- Ten throws a round. Beat your high score.\n\n## Pick your challenge\n- Four difficulty tiers: EASY, NORMAL, VIKING and BERSERKER.\n- Two venues to throw in \u2014 the Training Field and Fjord Lane.\n- Fjord Lane adds a distance ladder: land a scoring hit and the board steps farther away.\n- Leaderboards for your best rounds.\n\n## Built for comfort\n- Play seated or standing \u2014 everything is within arm's reach.\n- No artificial movement, no smooth turning, no vection. Comfortable rating.\n- Simple to learn, satisfying to master.", "short_description": "Grab an axe, wind up, and let it fly \u2014 sink bullseyes and climb the high-sco